## Why This Is Asked

This question validates real-world multi-inference orchestration, cross-account access patterns, and data governance in a single pipeline. It tests understanding of parallelism, stateful retries, cost optimization, and privacy controls.

## Key Concepts

- Step Functions orchestration with parallel branches for concurrent inference
- SageMaker endpoints for document extraction and risk classification
- S3 for structured output storage with versioning and lifecycle policies
- DynamoDB index design for efficient document lookups
- Cross-account IAM roles using STS AssumeRole with scoped permissions
- KMS encryption for data at rest and in transit
- Retry strategies with exponential backoff and DLQ for failure handling
- Cost considerations including endpoint autoscaling, payload optimization, and lifecycle policies

## Code Example

